{
  "title": "Hangover Cure Kenyan Matooke Stew",
  "description": "A hearty, bitter, creamy stew featuring matooke, cranberry juice, and a hint of pickle to cure your hangover woes. Served with a side of warm chapati.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free"
